    "description": "Item Description:\nThis vintage estate pipe is hand-carved from genuine Turkish block meerschaum and features an intricately detailed bearded Sultan bowl. Highly collectible for its artisan craftsmanship, the porous mineral has begun developing a beautiful, natural amber patina. It delivers an exceptionally cool, dry smoke and makes a striking addition to any tobacciana collection.\nManufacturer/Markings:\nHayim Pinhas\nDimensions (LxWxH):\n7x4x3\nColor(s):\nWhite\nCondition/Damage:\nUsed/Minor-Moderate Damage to box\nModel number, if applicable:\n17\nTested for power only if applicable:\nN/A\nWeight of item:\n1LBS\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold \"AS IS \" If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us.\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much research as possible with books andInternet, however, we are not experts in any field.\nEvery person has the opportunity to achieve his/her fullest potential and participate in and contribute to all aspects of life, and with your help, you are making dreams come true.\nGoodwill of Southeast Georgia, Thank you for your continued support!",
